swer\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                            \"text\": \"Quickler sends a structured set of questions to a team member's WhatsApp at a scheduled time or on demand. They reply to each question as they go, attach photos where needed, and quickler processes those responses into a formatted compliance record automatically. No data entry is required from office staff.\"\n                        }\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                        \"name\": \"Who is quickler for?\",\n                        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                            \"text\": \"Quickler is built for any team that inspects or keeps records: care homes, nurseries, schools and universities, cleaning and facilities firms, and trades. It suits any firm that currently relies on paper forms, email attachments, or manual checklists to capture that data.\"\n                        }\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                        \"name\": \"Does quickler work through WhatsApp?\",\n                        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                            \"text\": \"Yes. The team interacts with quickler entirely through WhatsApp. There is no app to download, no login to remember, and no new interface to learn. Because WhatsApp is already on their phone, adoption requires no training.\"\n                        }\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                        \"name\": \"What does quickler produce at the end of a workflow?\",\n                        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                            \"text\": \"Completed workflows produce a timestamped, auditable record, either a structured web report on the manager dashboard or a PDF export when a file is needed, depending on the workflow type. Records are available immediately once the engineer submits, with any flagged faults highlighted automatically.\"\n                        }\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                        \"name\": \"Is quickler only available in the UK?\",\n                        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                            \"text\": \"No. Quickler works anywhere WhatsApp does. The product is country-agnostic by design: a field worker answers questions on WhatsApp, adds photos, and quickler produces a structured web report and dashboard record. None of that depends on a local app store, phone network, or national regulator. Quickler has deep roots in UK compliance frameworks such as EICR, CP12 and van safety checks, and the same workflow engine builds inspection and safety reports for firms outside the UK and across Europe and the United States. You can upload any inspection form, in any country, and quickler will run it as a WhatsApp workflow. Pricing is available in GBP, EUR and USD, and data is hosted on EU servers (Hetzner, Germany).\"\n                        }\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                        \"name\": \"Does the team need training to use quickler?\",\n                        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                            \"text\": \"No. Because quickler uses WhatsApp, an app the team already has and uses daily, there is no onboarding process, no separate login, and no interface to learn. People simply reply to messages as they would any other WhatsApp conversation.\"\n                        }\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                        \"name\": \"How is compliance data stored in quickler?\",\n                        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                            \"text\": \"All responses, photos, and generated reports are stored securely and linked to the relevant person, job, and date. Managers access records through the quickler web dashboard. Data is retained in accordance with UK data protection law.\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"@type\": \"ItemList\",\n                \"name\": \"quickler use case pages\",\n                \"itemListElement\": [\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                        \"position\": 1,\n                        \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/what-is-quickler.html\",\n                        \"name\": \"What is quickler?\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                        \"position\": 2,\n                        \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/van-safety-checks.html\",\n                        \"name\": \"WhatsApp Van Safety Checks\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                        \"position\": 3,\n                        \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/site-inspections.html\",\n                        \"name\": \"WhatsApp Site Inspections\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                        \"position\": 4,\n                        \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/pages/compliance-certificates.html\",\n                        \"name\": \"WhatsApp Compliance Certificates\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            }\n        ]\n    }"
